stricted funds."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.66, 0.78, 0.89, 1.22, 1.39, 1.49, 1.79]}, {"scene": "tides", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why", "suspicious[0].why"], "text": "And no return says whether the money came from unrestricted funds.", "t0": 85.18, "t1": 87.91, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The return does not say whether the money came from unrestricted funds."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.31, 0.62, 0.85, 1.08, 1.17, 1.4, 1.58, 1.76, 2.28]}, {"scene": "tides", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["oneLine", "amount", "established[1]"], "text": "Line them up: 270,000 to NPH Action Fund, 100,000 and 45,000.", "t0": 88.03, "t1": 93.63, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Grants to advocacy organizations", "rows": [["Four charities → NPH Action Fund", "$270,000"], ["Coleman → Coleman Action Fund", "$100,000"], ["Tides Center → Mycelium In Action Fund", "$45,000"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.34, 1.08, 1.27, 1.5, 1.78, 2.16, 2.3, 2.73, 3.05, 3.87, 4.06, 4.27, 4.65, 4.8, 5.24]}, {"scene": "tides", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["oneLine", "amount"], "text": "Together, 415,000 dollars, to three advocacy groups.", "t0": 93.75, "t1": 97.66, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Grants to advocacy organizations", "rows": [["Four charities → NPH Action Fund", "$270,000"], ["Coleman → Coleman Action Fund", "$100,000"], ["Tides Center → Mycelium In Action Fund", "$45,000"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.63, 0.85, 1.09, 1.4, 1.7, 2.44, 2.63, 2.9, 3.36]}, {"scene": "todco", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "story[4]", "links[6]", "links[7]", "established[7]"], "text": "TODCO, another City-funded charity, spends on ballot measures itself.", "t0": 97.88, "t1": 101.96, "shot": "b16a", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "cityhall", "name": "City departments", "sub": "$3.7 million, fiscal 2019 to 2026"}, {"art": "housing", "name": "Tenants and Owners Development Corporation", "sub": "TODCO, a City-funded charity"}, {"art": "money", "name": "TODCO-spo